---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="How to reach the Long Press desk in Bengaluru: corrections, tips, privacy requests and sponsorship enquiries all go to one inbox."
>
  <div class="legal">
    <div class="page-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
      <h1>Contact the desk</h1>
      <p class="standfirst">
        One inbox, read by the person who writes the site.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:builtbyswami@gmail.com"><strong>builtbyswami@gmail.com</strong></a>. Long Press is published from Bengaluru, India (IST).
      </p>

      <h2 id="what-to-send">What to write about</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>A correction.</strong> Send the page link, the sentence that is wrong, and a source for the right answer if you have one. Corrections go out first. How they are handled is on the <a href="/about#corrections-and-contact">About page</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>A tip.</strong> Something quietly broken in a phone, an app, a subscription or a bill that you think the desk should look at.</li>
        <li><strong>A privacy request.</strong> To see, correct or delete data, see the <a href="/privacy#rights">Privacy Policy</a> and write to the same address.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising or sponsorship.</strong> Say what you want to run and when. Anything paid for is labeled as paid.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="elsewhere">Elsewhere</h2>
      <p>
        The <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Vb9DINGJf05fzD9slF3A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp channel</a> is broadcast only, so replies there do not reach the desk. The <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a> carries summaries of every issue and column. For the people and standards behind the site, see <a href="/about">About</a> and the <a href="/editorial-policy">Editorial Policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
